WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.600
After Qin Shi Huang unified the six states, he began a powerful rule.

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:11.000
One day, in the solemn court, he issued a harsh decree.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.500
Chancellor Li Si stood beside him, a stern look on his face.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:23.000
Soldiers collected bamboo scrolls from scholars' homes, and the mood grew very tense.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Many precious books were piled in courtyards and burned in the flames.

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:35.000
But some scholars risked danger and secretly hid important books.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Later came the terrible event known as the burying of the scholars.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Modern historians study these records carefully, trying to find the truth.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:51.000
History is complicated. When we read ancient stories, we should think deeply.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:56.980
Today, we too study with care, learning how to truly understand history.
